{
  "description": "Logical asset inventory for 0xCMS (W8, A.5.9). Lists what the code depends on and holds, not one deployment's resources: per-deployment names, account IDs and owners live in the deployment's restricted evidence system. tools/check-inventory.mjs fails CI when a binding, secret, variable or D1 table exists in source without an entry here, or an entry no longer exists in source.",
